      "chunk_text": "Customer Sai Kumar called insurance agent Anjali Desai to inquire about reinstating his expired auto policy (AP-001234) due to non-payment. Anjali confirmed reinstatement is possible with a $250 reinstatement fee and a $75 late fee, bringing the new annual premium to $1,200. After a brief pause, Sai agreed to proceed with the payment, and the agent initiated the verification process by asking for the policy number and date of birth.",
